      *################################################################*01670099
      * Initialization of necessary work fields                        *01680099
      *                                                                *01690099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01700099
       B000-Initialize                   Section.                       01710099
      *                                                                 01720099
           Initialize                          R7919999-Error           01730099
           Initialize                          W-Work-Fields            01740099
      *    Maximum number of occurences in ouput table.                 01750099
           Compute  Ws-Max-Occ-Item-Tab                                 01760099
               =  ( Length               Of    RTFCE110-I-Type-G        01770099
                  - Length               Of    RTFCE110-I-Type-A )      01780099
               /    Length               Of    RTFCE110-I-Type-T        01790099
           End-Compute                                                  01800099
      *                                                                 01810099
           .                                                            01820099
      *                                                                 01830099
       B000-Initialize-Ex.                                              01840099
           Exit.                                                        01850099
                                                                        01860099
      *################################################################*01870099
      * Add necessary preparation code here. Add Perform to other      *01880099
      * Dxxx- sections.                                                *01890099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01900099
       D000-Preparations                 Section.                       01910099
      *                                                                 01920099
           Perform D100-Read-Sys-Code-Rel                               01930099
      *                                                                 01940099
           .                                                            01950099
      *                                                                 01960099
       D000-Preparations-Ex.                                            01970099
           Exit.                                                        01980099
      *                                                                 01990099
      *################################################################*02000099
       D100-Read-Sys-Code-Rel            Section.                       02010099
      *                                                                 02020099
           Initialize                          R115ISR0-Sys-Code-Rel    02030099
           Set   R115ISR0-Version        To    True                     02040099
           Set   R115ISR0-In-Get-1st     To    True                     02050099
           Set   R115ISR0-In-CC-Count    To    True                     02060099
      *                                                                 02070099
           Move  RTFCE110-I-Fin-Inst-No-D                               02080099
                                         To    R115ISR0-In-F-I-No       02090099
           Move  'OPERATION-TYPE'        To    R115ISR0-In-From-ST-Type 02100099
           Move  RTFCE110-I-Operation-Type-D                            02110099
                                         To  R115ISR0-In-From-SC-Code   02120099
           Move  Spaces                  To  R115ISR0-In-From-Contr-Type02130099
      *                                                                 02140099
           Move  'STATUS'                To    R115ISR0-In-To-ST-Type   02150099
           Move  '*'                     To    R115ISR0-In-To-SC-Code   02160099
           Move  Spaces                  To    R115ISR0-In-To-Contr-Type02170099
      *                                                                 02180099
           Move  'VALID-OP-ST'           To    R115ISR0-In-Relation-Type02190099
                                                                        02200099
           Call  'F115ISR0'              Using R115ISR0-Sys-Code-Rel    02210099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      02220099
           End-Call                                                     02230099
      *                                                                 02240099
           Evaluate True                                                02250099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 02260099
               Move  'D101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       02270099
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    02280099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       02290099
      *                                                                 02300099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 02310099
               Move  'D102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       02320099
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    02330099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    02340099
      *                                                                 02350099
             When R115ISR0-Out-Total-Rows > 1                           02360099
               Move  'VAR1'              To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  02370099
               Move  RTFCE110-I-Operation-Type-D                        02380099
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 02390099
               Move  'TF-SY-STATUS-NOT-UNIQUE'                          02400099
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    02410099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    02420099
           End-Evaluate                                                 02430099
           .                                                            02440099
      *                                                                 02450099
       D100-Read-Sys-Code-Rel-Ex.                                       02460099
           Exit.                                                        02470099
                                                                        02480099
      *################################################################*02490099
