      *                                                                 07370099
               If   RTFCE110-I-Type-I (Ws-Idx)       = 'U'              07380099
               And RTFCE110-I-Type-D (Ws-Idx)       = 'REMIT'           07390099
               And RTFCE110-I-Selected-I (Ws-Idx)   = 'U'               07400099
               And RTFCE110-I-Selected-D (Ws-Idx)   = 'Y'               07410099
               And RTFCE110-I-Operation-Type-D      = 'REGISTER'        07420099
               And RTFCE110-I-Reference-I (Ws-Idx)  = 'U'               07430099
